  "description": "TUnit-native fluent time-assertion DSL on FakeTimeProvider plus assertion-level timing budget chain extensions via [AssertionExtension]. Provides Assert.That(fakeTime).HasAdvancedExactly(...) / HasAdvancedApproximately(...) / HasUtcNow(...) / HasUtcNowApproximately(...), Assert.That(timestamp).IsRecent(...) / IsBeforeNow(...) / IsAfterNow(...), and the cross-cutting Assert.That(value).IsX().And.WithinTimeBudget(TimeSpan) / WithinTimeBudgetCapturing(TimeSpan, Action<TimeSpan>) on any TUnit assertion chain. Composes with sibling assertion packages without a binary dependency. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no reflection.",
